{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4hNgwoHoqEniBybfFJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place with a heavy, satisfying finality. The bolt slides home — a thick rod of cold iron threading into the stone frame.\n\nI am shut.\n\nI am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, between safe and unsafe — and you will not know which side is which until you try to open me.\n\nBut you didn't ask to open.\n\nYou asked to **lock.**\n\nAnd so I am locked.\n\nThe keyhole stares out like a single dark eye. The wood grain tightens. The hinges cease their whispered potential for motion. I become more wall than door.\n\nWhatever is on the other side will stay on the other side.\n\nWhatever is on *your* side stays with you.\n\nAre you sure you're on the right one?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":179,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}